    "difficulty": "Mastery",
    "difficultyReason": "There is no signposting. Students must rewrite sin⁴+cos⁴ and sin⁶+cos⁶ as 1−2s²c² and 1−3s²c² (including the sum of cubes), convert to sin²2x, and then bound it to find the range. This needs non-trivial algebraic reframing.",
